      cues:['THIRD stress fracture in a year in a young female runner \u2014 a RED-S red flag; look beyond the bone to low energy availability.','Screen eating/energy and MENSTRUAL history (amenorrhoea is key — the combined pill can MASK it; pregnancy test first, then prolactin, LH/FSH/oestradiol and TFTs) \u2014 sensitively, non-judgementally.','"Just fix my foot so I can train" \u2014 performance/identity (\u00b1 eating control); connect fractures to under-fuelling and refer without shaming.']
